  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Redness</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Acne/Blemishes</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is:  </b>A hypochlorous acid serum to soothe and spot treat chronically sensitive skin. <br><br><b>Skin Type:</b> Normal, Dry, Combination, and Oily <br><br><b>Skincare Concerns:</b> Acne and Blemishes, Redness, and Uneven Texture<br><br><b>Formulation:</b> Gel<br><br><b>Highlighted Ingredients:<br></b>- Hypochlorous Acid: Defends your skin from harmful bacteria, reduces redness, and soothes irritation.<br>- Water and Sodium Chloride: Act as the optimal delivery solution for hypochlorous acid.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of parabens, phthalates, sulfates SLS & SLES, and contains less than one percent synthetic fragrance. It is also vegan and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> The only hypochlorous acid serum recognized by all three</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Dispense two to three pumps into clean hands. <br>-Apply to clean, dry skin all over or on targeted areas. <br>-Pro tip: Use SOS Daily Rescue Facial Spray (sold separately) as a toner followed by the serum and your favorite moisturizer for a double-hit of hypochlorous acid (your skin loves it) and the best possible results.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Hypochlorous Acid: Defends your skin from harmful bacteria, reduces redness, and soothes irritation.<br>-Water and Sodium Chloride: Act as the optimal delivery solution for hypochlorous acid.<br><br>Water, Sodium Magnesium Fluorosilicate, Sodium Phosphate, Sodium Chloride, Hypochlorous Acid.</div></details>",
